  "title_zh": "神舟二十四号出征仪式现场观众：祝成功，待凯旋",
  "title_en": "Spectators at Shenzhou-24 Send-off Ceremony: Wishing Success and a Triumphant Return",
  "summary_zh": "11月25日，神舟二十四号载人飞行任务航天员乘组出征仪式在酒泉卫星发射中心问天阁圆梦园广场举行，现场观众送上祝福，期盼凯旋。",
  "summary_en": "On November 25, the send-off ceremony for the Shenzhou-24 crew was held at the Jiuquan Satellite Launch Center, where spectators wished the astronauts success and a triumphant return.",
